Alembic migrations.

Generate a new revision:

    docker compose -f ops/compose.yml exec api alembic revision --autogenerate -m "<short slug>"

Apply:

    docker compose -f ops/compose.yml exec api alembic upgrade head

Check (runs in CI on every PR):

    docker compose -f ops/compose.yml exec api alembic check

The post_write_hook in alembic.ini auto-runs `ruff format` on every newly generated revision file.
